/-
The Antithesis harness's results (`examples/raft/antithesis`, #33 S4; `notes/antithesis-s4-design.md`
§1). For now the linked results of `Link.lean` (generated by `etc/gen-link.py --antithesis`), with
`#print axioms` of each: every harness function proved so far, over the checker's results
(`check/Link.lean`), raft's and Perennial's. `Main`'s result is linked over `RunCluster`'s spec, a
hypothesis until `RunCluster` is proved (`Link.lean`'s `links_pending`); `Cluster.run` is linked once
raft links its `RawNode` API specs and `Cluster.drain` is proved.

To come here (§1): the closed `raft_antithesis_safe` and `raft_antithesis_robust` (through an
`Adequacy.lean`) and the corollary `raft_antithesis_accepts`.
-/
